  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism with crownlike frill and broad pointed marginal plates; do not reduce to head. [\"Only cranium documented. Body, jaw, beak, colour, skin and keratin extensions reconstructed.\", \"Specimen deformed; do not copy asymmetry as a living diagnostic trait.\", \"Small skull fenestrae are bone openings, not mandatory holes through living skin.\"] {\"skull_sagittal_m\": 1.57, \"body_length_target_m\": 5.0, \"basis\": \"Skull1.57m published approximate, deformation caveat. Body5m is reconstruction working estimate, NOT measured whole skeleton.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism with crownlike frill and broad pointed marginal plates; do not reduce to head. [\"Only cranium documented. Body, jaw, beak, colour, skin and keratin extensions reconstructed.\", \"Specimen deformed; do not copy asymmetry as a living diagnostic trait.\", \"Small skull fenestrae are bone openings, not mandatory holes through living skin.\"] {\"skull_sagittal_m\": 1.57, \"body_length_target_m\": 5.0, \"basis\": \"Skull1.57m published approximate, deformation caveat. Body5m is reconstruction working estimate, NOT measured whole skeleton.\"}"
  },
